# This project's premise is byte-exactness: canonical bytes are signed, and test
# vectors are compared byte for byte. A line-ending conversion on checkout would
# silently change those bytes on some machines and not others - the worst kind of
# bug, because it only appears for other people.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched at all. These are the normative vectors; git must not rewrite a
# single byte of them under any platform or configuration.
conformance/vectors/*.json -text
LICENSE -text
